msgstr "**CI 闸拒绝**：`approved` **而没有对应的人类 `reviewed_by`**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 2f7062d0a020439b932df17ebbeb0beb
msgid "ch05 §\"Common mistakes\" #3"
msgstr "第 5 章 §“Common mistakes” #3"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: ea143f110cb4463cb4e9bf1727de5236
msgid "`doc_type` vocabulary has drifted to a long messy list"
msgstr "`doc_type` 的**词汇表**已经漂成**一个乱糟糟的长列表**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 640173970ae249759e6d731ba6a20b87
msgid "No enum closure in the validator"
msgstr "**校验器里没有把枚举闭合**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: d6cab6dfad5c496ea6630ce908621f67
msgid ""
"`doc_type` is a *closed* enumeration; reject unknown values at validation "
"time"
msgstr "`doc_type` 是一个 *封闭* 的枚举；**在校验时拒绝未知值**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 316800bc4780454f9d3b3ee27353ddc5
msgid "ch05 §\"Common mistakes\" #4"
msgstr "第 5 章 §“Common mistakes” #4"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 22fca5cbeb9f4bad9f103fc2b33af1ec
msgid "Pages marked `supported` for a commit that was rewritten twice"
msgstr "**被标记 `supported` 的页面**，**对应的 commit 已经被 rebase 改写过两次**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 8b3241da7c454fa9bd4c5c3c41823406
msgid "`verification_status` was not re-evaluated against `commit`"
msgstr "`verification_status` **没有相对** `commit` **被重新评估**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 874d43148efd4474949b21a0e59f8032
msgid ""
"Staleness detector demotes when footer `commit` no longer matches the code "
"it references"
msgstr "**腐化探测器**在 footer 的 `commit`**不再匹配它所引用的代码时**，**把信任降级**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 4f1966699f324f60931682401663c5ff
msgid "ch05 §\"Common mistakes\" #5"
msgstr "第 5 章 §“Common mistakes” #5"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: e8353b9e73244e1db20c14f0533aa921
msgid "`source.uri` points at a 404 or a silently reworded URL"
msgstr "`source.uri` 指向**一个 404**，**或者一个悄悄被改了措辞的 URL**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 1a4132854fec43d7b98da4511a31cb29
msgid "`source` has no `ref`"
msgstr "`source` **没有 `ref`**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 66b4fc820c744ec692731656f27136b2
msgid ""
"Every `source.uri` must carry a `ref`: commit SHA, Wayback snapshot, content"
" hash"
msgstr "**每一个** `source.uri` **都必须带一个** `ref` ：commit SHA、Wayback 快照、或内容 hash"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 78ada50cc2d64b9bbfe4fae1cc6b1fcc
msgid "ch05 §\"Common mistakes\" #6"
msgstr "第 5 章 §“Common mistakes” #6"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:447
#: 5f7cd26daf8b49df92974dbb38134202
msgid "Classification pipeline (Chapter 6)"
msgstr "**分类流水线**（第 6 章）"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 9b7335bb1406409e8a5b4d481b482df0
msgid "Imported page filed as `security-architecture` with `supported` trust"
msgstr "**导入进来的页面**被归到 `security-architecture` ，**且信任是** `supported`"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: ff8cee86fdd349ddbc4fc1f4b65d55a7
msgid "Prompt injection via imported content"
msgstr "**通过导入内容注入 prompt**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 282ea1ae82194afc81c89f06f17d3875
msgid ""
"Bound the classifier input; mark untrusted content explicitly; "
"`verification_status` is out of the LLM's output schema"
msgstr ""
"**给分类器的输入上界限**；**显式标注不可信内容**； `verification_status` **不在 LLM 的输出 schema 里**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: c409dc212f0b4be59fdd1069a32c9ec2
msgid "ch06 §\"LLM failure modes\" #1"
msgstr "第 6 章 §“LLM 的失败模式” #1"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 120068c654a642df9a3beb4d7de1c3fd
msgid "New, made-up category appeared in `content/`"
msgstr "**`content/` 里出现了一个新编出来的类别**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: aea335c6acb145848248760eee598011
msgid "Hallucinated label (closed enum not enforced)"
msgstr "**幻觉出来的标签**（**封闭枚举没有被强制**）"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 2ba52f3e8d9549878b0c751280ed3a60
msgid "Caller rejects out-of-enum labels; fall back to heuristic classifier"
msgstr "**调用方拒绝枚举之外的标签**；**回退到启发式分类器**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 2cb079a475d3446e873fe2478c82733a
msgid "ch06 §\"LLM failure modes\" #2"
msgstr "第 6 章 §“LLM 的失败模式” #2"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 343bf96715734717b406e3c631e23cf2
msgid "Gradual shift in category distribution over months"
msgstr "**几个月下来，类别分布在缓慢漂移**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: db082bf316ce49c69b1fd49906ac7f95
msgid "Silent model upgrade or corpus drift"
msgstr "**模型的静默升级**，**或者语料的漂移**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 141a156700e64728bbf9a805cf54e9fd
msgid "Check a ~50-page gold set into the repo; nightly CI diffs the labels"
msgstr "**往仓库里 check 一个 ~50 页的 gold set**；**夜间 CI diff 标签**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 76e2af801283430aaf9bdf0acb0e2ddd
msgid "ch06 §\"LLM failure modes\" #3"
msgstr "第 6 章 §“LLM 的失败模式” #3"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 280ea5e914c341b99994a93c30caee43
msgid "Half the weekend's ingest silently went through the heuristic"
msgstr "**周末一半的 ingest 悄无声息地走了启发式**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 5180549285294d548f0ee86834f3a376
msgid "JSON-mode parse failures were logged but not metricised"
msgstr "**JSON 模式解析失败被记了日志，但没有被做成度量**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 523faa1ec42f47d8bf6fb8030274c76d
msgid ""
"Use structured-output API; treat parse failures as a first-class metric"
msgstr "**用结构化输出 API**；**把解析失败当成一等公民的度量**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: c25544a925884bc7aaa089657fe6f66b
msgid "ch06 §\"LLM failure modes\" #4"
msgstr "第 6 章 §“LLM 的失败模式” #4"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 85a81251cbff4638b3f0572d0272ba70
msgid "Ingest batch cost exploded overnight"
msgstr "**ingest 批次的成本一夜之间爆炸**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 3785eca11fa64301abc0283db20e8adb
msgid "Provider pricing / throttling change"
msgstr "**供应商定价 / 限流变了**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 36a817de6e81444aa0d5dcb602c3cf35
msgid ""
"Hard budget per batch: max tokens, max wall-clock, abort and commit partial"
msgstr "**每批次硬预算**：最大 token、最大墙钟时间、**中止并 commit 部分结果**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 5c7e1d6b443945a0874fe584f844ff63
msgid "ch06 §\"LLM failure modes\" #5"
msgstr "第 6 章 §“LLM 的失败模式” #5"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 83114a3c539f488eb8de1b508e1986bd
msgid "Imported page's images 404 a year later"
msgstr "**一年之后，导入页面里的图片 404**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 74edcbae9eea49f594ed5e85c649493f
msgid "Importer did not rewrite asset URLs"
msgstr "**导入器没有重写资源 URL**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 30e6534b26d4455da34975232270b7eb
msgid ""
"The *ingest path* (one function) owns URL rewriting; every importer flows "
"through it"
msgstr "**由 *ingest 路径* （同一个函数）负责 URL 重写**；**每个导入器都流经它**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 6247760862e144048edd58ae2ba0dfee
msgid "ch06 §\"LLM failure modes\" #6"
msgstr "第 6 章 §“LLM 的失败模式” #6"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 983f99b7ce31456693b128131af7f8d7
msgid "Team treats Diátaxis labels as ground truth"
msgstr "**团队把 Diátaxis 标签当作 ground truth**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 188614a2b24c4e5fbfddbfc8f9c8adf3
msgid "Classification *is* a lossy projection"
msgstr "分类 *就是* 一次有损投影"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: e150ed74d79048d5b1d37560c2b751c6
msgid ""
"Record classifier uncertainty; route low-confidence to human review; treat "
"`unreviewed` as the honest default"
msgstr "**把分类器的不确定性记录下来**；**低置信度路由到人审**；**把 `unreviewed` 当作诚实的默认值**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 7b1ce951c76f4312adb4eb463ebfd8f5
msgid "ch06 §\"A note on what classification *is*\""
msgstr "第 6 章 §“关于分类 *究竟是什么* 的说明”"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:459
#: 1a182a9e425b41f6951260dd1894dd9c
msgid "Search and publishing (Chapter 7)"
msgstr "**搜索与发布**（第 7 章）"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 8b82ca3bf68943a3896901a436c05f6e
msgid "User searches for `throttle incoming traffic`, gets nothing"
msgstr "**用户搜** `throttle incoming traffic` ，**零结果**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: ab23435af0a04d12869068f6ea97897a
msgid "Vocabulary mismatch with identifier-literal"
msgstr "**和 identifier-literal 之间的词汇失配**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: ccd6c764bfa54c399e7d244343a1466d
msgid "Richer frontmatter `tags:` now; dense retrieval when it stops working"
msgstr "**先把 frontmatter 的** `tags:` **变丰富**；**等这招也不行时再上 dense retrieval**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 66064018137644bca8e8e3306c89bf3f
msgid "ch07 §\"Where the tiny search engine fails\" #1"
msgstr "第 7 章 §“这个小引擎会在哪里失败” #1"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 56294c9ea91a48cdbb7a4a4590014872
msgid "`配置文件` query returns nothing on CJK corpus"
msgstr "在中文语料上搜 `配置文件` **返回零结果**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 2409acc97a70409bba4ee41a516bcc59
msgid "No segmentation; `unicode.IsLetter` does not split"
msgstr "**没有分词**；`unicode.IsLetter` **不会切分**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 594c1598e18444958c45654fcb7026d6
msgid "Swap `tokenize` for a CJK segmenter (`go-jieba`, `kagome`)"
msgstr "把 `tokenize` **换成**一个中文分词器（`go-jieba` 、`kagome`）"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 42e6ccde488043e2b45b619143638084
msgid "ch07 §\"Where the tiny search engine fails\" #2"
msgstr "第 7 章 §“这个小引擎会在哪里失败” #2"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 11c4ab74cc0c4660abdeb1a438618ad3
msgid "`recieve` returns nothing, users annoyed"
msgstr "**`recieve` 返回零结果，用户抓狂**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: e10b87be74274c03a707ae0e79ad1c8c
msgid "No typo tolerance"
msgstr "**没有拼写容错**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 8d82abe37fea4637b1d0d5688fbccf37
msgid "Fuzzy matching in-process up to ~100k terms; Meilisearch above that"
msgstr "**词数在 ~10 万以内**：**进程内做 fuzzy matching**；**超过之后换 Meilisearch**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 7f2f35d09a994c2fbffd371a8a2bb9a5
msgid "ch07 §\"Where the tiny search engine fails\" #3"
msgstr "第 7 章 §“这个小引擎会在哪里失败” #3"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 99116d816b6b460492a6a64e17ee6730
msgid "Long-but-irrelevant pages outrank focused ones"
msgstr "**冗长但不相关的页面**排在**聚焦的页面**前面"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 2458c8b7fabb4b949c5eb60a22bd3396
msgid "Score is term-cardinality, no length normalisation"
msgstr "**打分用的是词命中数，没有长度归一化**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 1defbcf346854c83a5fc3f731670d844
msgid "Field weighting on `title`; escalate to BM25 when the pattern persists"
msgstr "**在 `title` 上做字段加权**；**这个模式持续出现时**，**升级到 BM25**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 24d81a6aa5d64e06b87f0e7f891866cb
msgid "ch07 §\"Where the tiny search engine fails\" #4"
msgstr "第 7 章 §“这个小引擎会在哪里失败” #4"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 04090d8c7e5740cda7fc545fe7e17bbd
msgid "Incremental index is stale yet debugging is hard"
msgstr "**增量索引陈旧，但 debug 又很难**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: f772c6e1561b40659a68fe1b2ea7002f
msgid "Incremental update is the failure mode of most DB-backed wikis"
msgstr "**增量更新**就是**大多数数据库型 wiki 的失败模式**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: eed4d37c98e444ef88a0ed3b708f164a
msgid "Whole-map rebuild on write; milliseconds at this scale"
msgstr "**写的时候整张表重建**；在这个规模上只是毫秒级"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: a6562afb35714274a1bfca6ea8cd80da
msgid "ch07 §\"Common mistakes in wiring up search\" #1"
msgstr "第 7 章 §“接线搜索时的常见错误” #1"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 297e3fa3ec4b4074b6ef53667e91385b
msgid "Live server and static site return different results"
msgstr "**在线服务和静态站点返回不同的结果**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: a53c1f45b5a247a3836679b949df4907
msgid "Two search layers running in parallel"
msgstr "**两层搜索在并行运行**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: c24c1f19770f4dcf845559ae7d37a198
msgid "Staircase is a *sequence* — pick one layer, keep one interface"
msgstr "**阶梯是一条 *序列* —— 只选一层，只保留一个接口**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 71656aa5607149c5a682d550b1d31187
msgid "ch07 §\"Common mistakes in wiring up search\" #2"
msgstr "第 7 章 §“接线搜索时的常见错误” #2"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 398ddc8f34b44eadb77adb7d160f792b
msgid "`contradicted` pages surface in default search"
msgstr "**`contradicted` 的页面在默认搜索里冒出来**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 4be2532801ba47b6a341b62576640e26
msgid "Trust fields are not retrieval metadata yet"
msgstr "**信任字段还没被当成检索用的元数据**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: edbd087530864040ba968f7e2cc42e09
msgid ""
"Filter by `verification_status` at query time; explicit \"include "
"superseded\" toggle"
msgstr "**查询时按 `verification_status` 过滤**；**给一个显式的“包括已过时页面”开关**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 0172c1ebb64c4d40b0cdaab04eea2168
msgid "ch07 §\"Common mistakes in wiring up search\" #3"
msgstr "第 7 章 §“接线搜索时的常见错误” #3"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: e8e627cbd7d440d99d1518766ec37623
msgid "Org relies on Sphinx client-side search for authenticated users"
msgstr "**组织把 Sphinx 的客户端搜索给已登录用户用**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 12373557cb964bea974dd02533c7bb9f
msgid "Static search is blind to frontmatter / trust fields"
msgstr "**静态搜索看不见 frontmatter / 信任字段**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 0fe28aefae8b4491bc13cddfe3037545
msgid "Server search is authoritative; static search is for public / offline"
msgstr "**服务端搜索是权威的**；**静态搜索给的是公开 / 离线场景**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 3361dfa5a613495f93daef1fbb7b3d68
msgid "ch07 §\"Common mistakes in wiring up search\" #4"
msgstr "第 7 章 §“接线搜索时的常见错误” #4"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:472
#: 9d6817da2c3b40d88fa3e1ae2fbb3833
msgid "Operational model (Chapter 7a)"
msgstr "**运维模型**（第 7a 章）"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: ecc1ab012ae34cf6b6771774a2de0591
msgid "Every page `approved`, content still wrong"
msgstr "**每一页都 `approved`，内容依然是错的**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 2c8a924dc94144a7ab6b5c76f98b7d12
msgid "Gates check form, not truth"
msgstr "**闸检查的是形式，不是真相**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 9c24f4071ded49ab84f57fbfb00710c2
msgid ""
"`approved` means *a human read the diff*, not *this is correct*; add second-"
"reviewer rule for security-sensitive pages"
msgstr "`approved` **表示** *一个人读过这次 diff* ，**不是** *这是对的* ；**对安全敏感页面加第二评审人规则**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 0db2a6ebb91946948fb6b88dc45fe838
msgid "ch07a §\"What this model does *not* solve\" #1, #2"
msgstr "第 7a 章 §“这个模型 *并没有* 解决的问题” #1、#2"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 04c0f36ac9094e0ca81bfca93f043e6e
msgid "10k `approved` pages, user still can't find the right one"
msgstr "**一万个 `approved` 页面，用户还是找不到对的那一个**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: de60361fa9204f0aacbde451ee772b3d
msgid "Model makes KB trustworthy, not *usable*"
msgstr "**模型让知识库变得可信，不是变得** *可用* "

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch07a-prose-operational-model.md:24
#: 57267daa33f24f31b958b4f0fd78523e
msgid "Prioritisation is Diátaxis + curation, independent of trust"
msgstr "**优先排序是 Diátaxis + 策展**，**和信任是正交的**"

